      <Comment source="PMN, hawkins, SRI, caspi">|FRAME: CPD-7710 Thebaine| is a pentacyclic opiate alkaloid intermediate in the biosynthesis of |FRAME: MORPHINE| by the opium poppy |FRAME: TAX-3469|. It is the first opiate alkaloid that is formed in the pathway. |FRAME: CPD-7710 Thebaine| is used as a precursor for the synthesis of several pharmaceuticals including |FRAME: CPD-22083|, |FRAME: CPD-22084|, |FRAME: CPD-22085| and |FRAME: CPD-22086| |CITS: [20228795]|.</Comment>
